Description:You are at 2 life. The opponent's Kitchen Finks (3/2, persist) and Grizzly Bears (2/2) are attacking you. You control Cystbearer (2/3, infect) and Hill Giant (3/3). End the turn with no creatures on the opponent's battlefield.
Rule:authored-persist-infect | Infect damage to a creature is dealt as -1/-1 counters (CR 702.90c, 120.3d), and persist returns a creature only if it had no -1/-1 counters on it (CR 702.79a): Finks killed by Cystbearer stays dead, while Finks killed by Hill Giant's ordinary damage returns
